si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5862d896bbc18f52fbae68cf98355a06, https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f49fa7728806f4634a4c3d539afbb3b8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85fdb83b/uploads/origins/a11973a5-39ad-4caf-8135-6fea574fe0ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ba2557d020905dab9c45ca5c8d6be7f7 3x"}, "body": "Hello Mr. Pop Rice, nice to meet you.\nI apologize for the length of this message.\nI apologize for sending it twice.\n\n\u3000I love your pictures, which seem to be filled with cuteness, beauty, and sparkle, so I wanted to commission them!\n\n\u3000I would like you to draw a full-body illustration of an animal for me.\n(1) Horses (I really like Popmai's horses...)\n2) Some kind of real animal (any kind of animal is fine)\n(3) An imaginary animal (I like any kind of animal)\n(I would like you to name this imaginary animal if possible.)\n\u3000I have a \"Silhouette Detective Kit\" that I am trying to make, and I would like to use it as one of the cards.\n\nI don't know how to send you the materials, so I will post the link I mumbled on Twitter. I apologize for my catastrophically bad explanation.\nhttps://twitter.com/memomomomomemo/status/1595741947221913600?s=20&t=VKMsH7D4rrg996gTidG71A\nThe second through fourth examples are the results of a prototype that was tested.\n\nThe simple explanation is this play.\n\n[Steps to play Silhouette Detective Kit.\nThere is a story about a bad pair of scissors that has torn apart the bodies of the animals, and they need to fix everyone's body to save them.\n\n1) Look at the animal samples.\n\u2461Express the silhouettes of the animals by combining the shapes of the sheets\n(3) Animals regain their bodies\n\n\nI am thinking of preparing photos and illustrations of these animal samples, and was wondering if you could draw some of the illustrations.\n(I draw 80% of the illustrations myself, but I came to skeb because I thought I would like this research twice as much if I could have my favorite illustrator do the illustrations as well.)\n\n\u3000At this stage, I am not thinking of selling my works, and this is just a trial stage of my research (more of a hobby). Ideally, I want to wipe away the painful memories and sense of difficulty that children and adults have when it comes to \"making things,\" and I have made a plan to make various things more fun.\n\n\n\u3000Sorry for the long time!\n\u3000Please feel free to take my request as just a hobby and I would be happy if you could write it for me.\n\u3000If you have time, I'd appreciate it!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@pop_KOME/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 709024, "client_id": 293143, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e80e8f2dbaffdfbb4b8b7fe47183faec", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e80e8f2dbaffdfbb4b8b7fe47183faec, https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ab03fbaf3cb897a755fe823ab1438dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bfcb943f/uploads/origins/5bd9ed73-e199-4e6e-a949-cc3aa2d88204?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9c567affc4a3682280c398d2fe18cfe7 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_i